{"content_html": "<div>\n<!-- BEGIN COMPONENT:: COMPONENT002494 -->\n<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HUSfCZVWAAAdVoG.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/10/11/husfczvwaaadvog-187.jpg?width=0&amp;s=ktewevVn5Nr0pOwRvynAQQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Trận cầu hấp dẫn khép lại với tỷ số hòa 1-1 - Ảnh: P.L</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>Đội hình ra sân</strong></p>\n<p><strong>MU:</strong> Lammens; Yoro, Maguire, Martinez, Shaw; Mainoo, Tielemans; Mbeumo, Fernandes, Amad; Cunha.</p>\n<p><strong>Tottenham: </strong>Kinsky; Gray, Senesi, Van Hecke, Udogie; Gallagher, Tonali, Bergvall; Savio, Solanke, Kudus.</p>\n<p><strong>Bàn thắng: </strong>Mbeumo 73' - Solanke 90'+2</p>\n<p><strong>Thẻ đỏ:</strong> Bentancur 77'</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td>Kết quả</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span>Vòng 6</span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10/10/2026 18:30:00</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/media.api-sports.io/football/teams/42.png?width=0&amp;s=_FcjsFh1FiYTOWhEUaDj9A\"/></picture>Arsenal </a> 2 - 1 <a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/media.api-sports.io/football/teams/63.png?width=0&amp;s=41UpSIIEGLF4HT1Y06ljJg\"/></picture> Leeds </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10/10/2026 21:00:00</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/media.api-sports.io/football/teams/66.png?width=0&amp;s=xSAef_jCwAIS2fAYQiZCCw\"/></picture>Aston Villa </a> 2 - 2 <a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <pict